--- located heading + note 1 (lines 2197, 2224-2228); quote at line 2227 ---
     1	### GET `/models`: List available models
     2	
     3	Listing all models in cache. The model metadata will also include a field to indicate the status of the model:
     4	Note:
     5	1. Adding `?reload=1` to the query params will refresh the list of models. The behavior is as follow:
     6	    - If a model is running but updated or removed from the source, it will be unloaded
     7	    - If a model is not running, it will be added or updated according to the source
     8	2. When the model is loaded, the info from `/v1/models` is forwarded to router's `/v1/models`. This includes metadata about the model and the runtime instance.
